{"name":"Havana Cigar","hex":"#af884a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cigar","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cylinder of tobacco rolled and wrapped with an outer covering of tobacco leaves, intended to be smoked.","The penis. (Can we add an example for this sense?)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cigar"}],"entries":[{"title":"Habanos S.A.","blocks":[{"text":"Habanos S.A. is a Cuban manufacturing company of tobacco that controls the promotion, distribution, and export of premium cigars and other tobacco products for Cuba worldwide. It was established in 1994."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Habanos_S.A.","wikidata":"Q1142914"},{"title":"Havana","blocks":[{"text":"Havana is the capital and largest city of Cuba. The heart of La Habana Province, Havana is the country's main port and commercial center. It is the most populous city, the largest by area, and the second-largest metropolitan area in the Caribbean region. The population in 2021 was 2,142,939 inhabitants, and its area is 728.26 km2 (281.18 sq mi) for the capital city and 8,475.57 km2 for the metropolitan zone. Its official population however had dropped to 1,749,964 inhabitants by the end of 2024."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/DJI_0197_crp_wiki.jpg/330px-DJI_0197_crp_wiki.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Havana","wikidata":"Q1563"},{"title":"Cigar","blocks":[{"text":"A cigar is a rolled bundle of dried and fermented tobacco leaves made to be smoked. Cigars are produced in a variety of sizes and shapes. Since the 20th century, almost all cigars are made of three distinct components: the filler, the binder leaf which holds the filler together, and a wrapper leaf, which is often the highest quality leaf used. Often there will be a cigar band printed with the cigar manufacturer's logo. Modern cigars can come with two or more bands, especially Cuban cigars, showing Limited Edition bands displaying the year of production."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Cigar_tube_and_cutter.jpg/330px-Cigar_tube_and_cutter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cigar","wikidata":"Q1576"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg/500px-El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg/1280px-El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg/500px-El_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEl_Capitolio_Havana_Cuba.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg/500px-Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg/1280px-Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/73/Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg/500px-Castillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_%28Jan_2014%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACastillo_de_la_Real_Fuerza_(Jan_2014).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/L%C3%ADnea%2C_La_Habana%2C_Cuba.jpg/500px-L%C3%ADnea%2C_La_Habana%2C_Cuba.jpg?utm_s